SELECT 9, 354, 1, 0.25, N'In TOEIC Part 1, why is the statement ''The bicycle is being repaired'' incorrect if the photo shows bicycles parked on an empty street with no mechanic present?', N'Statement A: A man is fixing a bicycle wheel.
Statement B: Some boxes are stacked on the shelf.
Statement C: The woman is paying for merchandise.
